# What the editor's Play reads (petslike_core.c book_driver()). Same row shape as @.apps/snake/game.pdl.
# The driver is this book's loop only. The verbs are tearit_map_op. The world clock stays paused.
GAME   | name        | tearit-map
GAME   | title       | Tearit map
GAME   | driver      | {book}/ops/+x/tearit_driver.+x {house} {book} {editor}
GAME   | clock       | pause
